      "name": "iterativeSolution",
      "description": "",
      "approach": "- Use a loop to calculate the power of x to the power of n\n - If x is 0 and n is less than or equal to 0, return NaN\n - If x is 0, return 0\n - If n is 0, return 1\n - Otherwise, return x to the power of n",
      "timeComplexity": "O(log |n|)",
      "spaceComplexity": "O(1)",
      "code": "<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">iterativeSolution</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">x, n</span>) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (x === <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> &amp;&amp; n &lt;= <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NaN</span>;\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (x === <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>;\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (n === <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>;\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> result = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> power = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Math</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">abs</span>(n);\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> base = n &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> ? x : <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> / x;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span> (power &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (power % <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span> === <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>) {\n      result *= base;\n    }\n    base *= base;\n    power = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Math</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">floor</span>(power / <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> result;\n};\n</code></pre>",
